{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Implementation note: _repair_pause.py and _lib_ops.py needed no change; their contracts are covered by tests/scripts/graph/test_repair_pause_ownership.py, tests/interfaces/store/test_repair_pause_ownership_heldout.py and test_bridge_cli_heldout.py pause/resume tests (all pass) plus test_clear_gate_reports_whether_it_changed_anything. Four existing test files beyond the two the plan named also read the remote ref as a raw blob or expected release to delete it (test_advisory_lock.py, test_advisory_lock_ref_backend.py, test_bridge_status.py, test_lock_orphan_local_ref.py); they now read through the commit and treat markers as free. test_last_pass_cas_retries_exactly_three_times_with_jittered_backoff faked contention with an unchanged tip; it now moves the remote tip, because a refused fast-forward with an unchanged tip is a genuine failure by design. File impact updated to the 16 touched paths."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793392799460792001,"uuid":"2a674b1c-d953-4275-8086-f403375ad01d"}